sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Controller
    participant B as Box
    U->>C: box start coder
    C->>B: launch holder
    alt resume
        B-->>C: SessionStart resume
    else new
        B-->>C: SessionStart startup
    end
    loop every report
        B->>C: statusline
    end
    C-->>U: attached
